  {
   "id": "citydriver-217210@major-2025-07-01",
   "gameId": "citydriver-217210",
   "displayName": "Free update out now!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-07-01T14:00:46.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "CityDriver Free Update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're happy to present a new update for CityDriver on all platforms! Check below for the Changelog!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun driving!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-F2A7oVIeWs\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Performance Improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks to the update to a new version of Unreal Engine 5, we can take advantage of a new system that improves the game’s performance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you could previously only play on medium graphics settings, you'll now likely be able to play on higher settings.*",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42791338/eb78958e369005797e9f2d449ab0b0a9534b936f.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improved Lighting and Foliage",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With the engine update, we’re using an enhanced lighting system that makes lighting situations in the game appear much more beautiful!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Foliage in trees and bushes also looks more realistic now. Look forward to an even more detailed and immersive depiction of Munich!*",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42791338/f3c7bb0389ac2ca8285877afefed60d165f7f97d.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Day-Night Cycle",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With the brand-new day-night cycle in the game, you can now explore the streets of Munich even in the dark!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enjoy picturesque sunsets and take on the challenge of navigating the city's dark alleys.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42791338/88f49aa2eeebe7e34a08e1bbcd513b9ffa604865.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Saved Mission Progress",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Your mission progress is now saved! Play through all missions with top ratings and beat your own high scores.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With this update, you can track your achievements and aim for even better results.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Can you follow every traffic rule?",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42791338/67156f05fab460733702a1139afa5737245eb0a8.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Improved AI and Vehicle Physics",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The AI of NPC vehicles has been improved to better follow traffic rules.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Vehicle physics have also been optimized, so you no longer spin out as easily after collisions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42791338/178c835bc174ac8c43a75464ac82e8bb5b723324.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Of course, this update also fixes several annoying bugs and potential crashes!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "*Due to the many different PC systems and hardware configurations, improvements will vary in impact. Performance and graphical improvements will be most noticeable on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
